    "The spec's fake Ayun renders each truck's track as the device points the provider would hold (every 30 s while moving, every 60 s while parked) and answers OBJECT_GET_LOCATIONS / OBJECT_GET_ROUTE in the recorded shapes of locations.json and route.json, the webhook in the shape of webhook-depot-in.txt.",
    "Provider quirks recorded here: T05's tracker has no coverage for 6 minutes just before shop C (its arrival there is not observed); T06's points of 07:40-07:52 reach the provider only at 08:30 (buffered); one forged Depot IN webhook, one repeated webhook and one webhook for a tracker that is not ours."
